      "body": "## Motivation\n\nCurrent main already batches the nine real performance-failure scenarios in one retry runner (#44508). The remaining integration test can stop after one attempt when it inherits an expired `SGLANG_DIFFUSION_RETRY_DEADLINE`, and it checks console output without verifying each final JUnit failure.\n\n## Modifications\n\nClear the inherited deadline only for the seven-attempt exhaustion fixture. Verify the exact set of ten JUnit items, a retained `[performance]` failure for each of the nine scenarios, and the independent infrastructure timeout. Existing retry-budget tests still exercise the deadline policy. Production code, thresholds and retry counts are unchanged; only twelve lines are added to the current test file.\n\n## Validation\n\nSynced with main `913e91ed`, candidate `5c553e5c`. RTX 5090 D v2 development host, Python 3.12, PyTorch 2.13.0+cu130:\n\n- Complete `test_performance_failure_policy.py`: **26 passed**, pytest 112.93 s.\n- Same complete file with `SGLANG_DIFFUSION_RETRY_DEADLINE=1`: **26 passed**, pytest 111.67 s.\n- All imported repository source hashes match the candidate. Changed-file pre-commit and diff checks pass.\n\n```sh\npython -m pytest -q python/sglang/multimodal_gen/test/unit/test_performance_failure_policy.py\nSGLANG_DIFFUSION_RETRY_DEADLINE=1 python -m pytest -q python/sglang/multimodal_gen/test/unit/test_performance_failure_policy.py\n```\n\nThe former 63-to-7 subprocess optimization is already upstream via #44508. This PR now adds report-integrity/deadline regression coverage; it claims no additional inference or test-runtime speedup. Native AMD CI remains separate.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39827600339](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39827600339)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39827599855](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39827599855)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39827599829](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39827599829)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
