  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Reconciled this PR with merged #44508 in `5c553e5c`; thanks for landing the batching improvement. The remaining patch is twelve test-only lines: isolate the seven-attempt exhaustion fixture from an inherited deadline and verify every final JUnit failure, while retaining the existing deadline-budget tests.\n\nThe full file passes on the current source both normally and with `SGLANG_DIFFUSION_RETRY_DEADLINE=1`: **26 passed** in each run (112.93 s / 111.67 s pytest time). Imported source hashes and changed-file pre-commit checks pass. The title and description now describe only this remaining scope; the historical 7.57× test-runtime result is no longer presented as a new improvement over main.\n\nReproducible numeric evidence, source/head mappings and platform limitations: https://github.com/Tokha233/ComfyUI-H3-SpeedKit/tree/0c125c6/evidence/pr-maintenance-1023 .\n\nLatest-head CI stops at the permission gate: `Missing required label 'run-ci'`. Could a maintainer authorize the normal CI for this updated head? These are permission-gate failures, not executed GPU test failures.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:00:54Z",
